  m_Name: Glasshouse Cell Config 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Glasshouse
  Description: 'Seed Tray - intensity 1 of Glasshouse: four seeds out at once and few grazers - room to
    learn planting and tending. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u). No
    environment and NOTHING planted wild - every plant is an Angler''s seed, cacti at 1.4x
    leaf, up to 36 plants between every colour (160 prisms, ~32,928 volume each at
    maturity). 6 tameable tadpoles graze every garden outside the nucleus; 4 omni crystals
    respawn inside it (the scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena
    (7,817 prisms, 1,355,122 volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_glasshouse_assets.py -
    re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
